            <title>[LU-20521] split &apos;lnetctl.8&apos; man page into one page per subcommand</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20521</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Similar to &lt;tt&gt;lfs&amp;#45;&amp;#42;.1&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;lctl&amp;#45;&amp;#42;.8&lt;/tt&gt; man pages, the monolithic &lt;tt&gt;lnetctl.8&lt;/tt&gt; man page should be split into a separate page per sub-command.  That allows a more complete description of the command, including full descriptions all of the options, usage and recommendations, and room for examples and links to other related (sub-)commands.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
